<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n92544" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥῖψις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>, ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>throwing, hurling</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοξικὴ καὶ
				πᾶσα ῥ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				813e
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Ph.</u>
				243a20
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				257a3
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Str.
				6.1.1
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> pl.,
				<i>glances</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥίψεις ὀμμάτων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Sull.</u>
					35
				</span></i>
			; but <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥῖψις ὄμματος</span>
			<i>drooping</i> of eyelid, read by <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
			</span></i>(<i><span class="en">
				17
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				1
			</span></i>).<i><span class="en">
				895
			</span></i>) for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔρριψις</span> in <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Epid.</u>
				6.1.5
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>being thrown</i> or <i>hurled</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἡφαίστου ῥίψεις ὑπὸ πατρός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>R.</u>
					378d
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥ. καὶ πτῶσις οὐρανίων σωμάτων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Lys.</u>
					12
				</span></i>
			; <i>throwing oneself</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥίψεις ἐπὶ πρόσωπον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					2.166a
				</span></i>
			.</div>
